1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:17,150
An old woman begging for food, luckily got a kind mother and child giving food and letting her stay overnight.

2
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:37,710
Next day, old woman gave mother and child a bag of ashes and two rice husks.

3
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:51,250
Grandma said: Sister sprinkle ashes around house to avoid disaster.

4
00:00:53,820 --> 00:01:00,740
Rice husks used to save people.

5
00:01:01,170 --> 00:01:06,200
After saying, grandma disappeared.

6
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:16,340
Mother and child sprinkled ashes around house.

7
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:30,280
They told people near house to also avoid, but no one believed.

8
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:45,570
That night there was flood. Land sank, many houses submerged in water.

9
00:01:48,570 --> 00:01:58,280
Only mother and child's house floor rose little by little, still dry.

10
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:07,800
Mother and child put rice husks on water. Rice husks turned into boat.

11
00:02:12,050 --> 00:02:21,740
Mother and child rowed boat to rescue people in trouble.

12
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:38,710
Where land sank, now is Ba Be Lake.

